## ------------------------------------------------------------------------
@node "Help on help"
@{U}Using this help@{u}

  Click an underlined or highlighted word to follow it. In EHypView
  and ST-Guide, Undo or Backspace goes back, and the Index lists every
  page.

  Back to the @{"Contents" link "Main"}.
@endnode
